/* نسخہ 157 — بیرونی ریپرٹری خول — اصل مواد کے انداز میں مداخلت کیے بغیر */
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:5px;
    flex-wrap:nowrap;
    direction:ltr!important;
    justify-content:flex-start;
    overflow-x:auto;
    position:relative;
    z-index:80;
    min-height:49px;
    margin-bottom:0!important;
    padding:7px 9px;
    background:#1f2a44;
    border-radius:12px;
    scrollbar-width:thin;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#536487;border-radius:4px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:2px;
    flex:0 0 auto;
    height:35px;
    margin-inline-end:4px;
    padding-inline-end:5px;
    border-inline-end:1px solid #455777;
    direction:ltr;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav .rep-navbtn,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav .rep-shell-side-btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    flex:0 0 24px;
    width:24px;
    height:24px;
    min-width:24px;
    padding:0;
    border:1px solid #586b8d;
    border-radius:6px;
    background:#233352;
    color:#e8eef8;
    font:12px Arial,sans-serif;
    cursor:pointer;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav .rep-navbtn:hover:not(:disabled),
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav .rep-shell-side-btn:hover{background:#3b5077;border-color:#93a5ff;color:#fff}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav .rep-navbtn:disabled{opacity:.4}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-strip-nav .rep-shell-side-btn{font-size:14px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-gradation{
    display:flex!important;
    align-items:center;
    gap:3px;
    flex:0 0 auto;
    color:#d5deeb;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-grad-item{color:#d5deeb;padding:3px 4px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-viewtoggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;flex:0 0 auto}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-navbtn,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-viewbtn{
    width:35px;
    height:35px;
    min-width:35px;
    padding:0;
    border:1px solid #4b5b7d;
    border-radius:8px;
    background:#2b3a5c;
    color:#e6edf8;
    font-size:15px;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-navbtn:hover:not(:disabled),
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-viewbtn:hover{border-color:#8297ff;background:#3a4d75;color:#fff}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-navbtn:disabled{opacity:.4}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-viewbtn.active{border-color:#7692ff;background:#5b7cfa;color:#fff}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-book-select, 
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-scope-select,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-type-select,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-lib-btn{display:none!important}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-search-wrap{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:7px;
    flex:1 1 260px;
    min-width:170px;
    height:35px;
    margin:0;
    padding:0 9px;
    border:1px solid #dce4ef;
    border-radius:8px;
    background:#fff;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-search-wrap input{
    flex:1 1 auto;
    min-width:0;
    height:100%;
    border:0;
    outline:0;
    background:transparent;
    color:#20324f;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    text-align:start;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar .rep-search-ico{flex:0 0 auto;color:#536487}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-icon,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repCmpModeBtn,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repUrModeBtn{
    position:relative;
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    flex:0 0 35px;
    width:35px;
    height:35px;
    min-width:35px;
    padding:0;
    border:1px solid #4b5b7d;
    border-radius:8px;
    background:#2b3a5c;
    color:#e6edf8;
    font:15px Arial,sans-serif;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:none;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-icon:hover,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repCmpModeBtn:hover,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repUrModeBtn:hover{background:#3a4d75}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-icon:focus-visible,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repCmpModeBtn:focus-visible,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repUrModeBtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffcf4b;outline-offset:2px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-icon.on{border-color:#7692ff;background:#5b7cfa}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-icon .rep-shell-arrow{position:absolute;inset-inline-end:3px;bottom:1px;font:8px Arial}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repCmpModeBtn,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repUrModeBtn{font-size:14px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repCmpModeBtn span,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repUrModeBtn span{display:none!important}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-toolbar #repCmpModeBtn.on{border-color:#7692ff;background:#5b7cfa}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-icon.rep-shell-compare{border-color:#1ac6b1;background:#12b3a0;color:#fff;font-size:16px}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu-wrap{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;flex:0 0 auto}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;
    z-index:120;
    display:none;
    min-width:238px;
    max-width:min(320px,calc(100vw - 16px));
    padding:6px;
    border:1px solid #d9e1ec;
    border-radius:10px;
    background:#fff;
    color:#23344f;
    box-shadow:0 12px 28px #1627462b;
    direction:rtl;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu.open{display:block}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu button{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    width:100%;
    gap:8px;
    padding:8px 10px;
    border:0;
    border-radius:7px;
    background:#fff;
    color:#263854;
    font:12.5px Tahoma,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    text-align:start;
    cursor:pointer;
}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu button:hover,
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu button.selected{background:#edf1fc}
#page-repertoryBrowser .rep-shell-menu button.selected::after{content:"✓";margin-inline-start:auto;color:#12a88f;font-weight:bold}

